.TH TUNED-RS-PPD 8 "July 2026" "tuned-rs 0.2.3" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
tuned-rs-ppd \- translate power-profiles-daemon requests to TuneD profiles
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tuned-rs-ppd
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tuned-rs-ppd
provides the power-profiles-daemon D-Bus interfaces and maps desktop power
profiles to profiles managed by
.BR tuned-rs (8).
.PP
The daemon is normally managed through
.BR systemctl (1)
using the
.B tuned-rs-ppd.service
unit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/tuned/ppd.conf
Power profile mappings and battery-detection settings.
.TP
.I /etc/tuned/ppd_base_profile
Persisted desktop power profile.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tuned-rs (8),
.BR systemctl (1)
